WEBVTT

00:00:08.410 --> 00:00:18.500
What is it about the very young that so easily brings a smile to our face?

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:24.890
Why should we find babies who are not our own so appealing?

00:00:24.890 --> 00:00:30.000
Some would say that cute is in the eye of the beholder.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:38.980
Some little faces only a mother could love, but in fact, it seems we're hardwired to find

00:00:38.980 --> 00:00:46.950
certain little ones adorable, even if they're not our own kind, and we can't help but root

00:00:46.950 --> 00:00:49.680
for them as they make their way in the world.

00:00:52.100 --> 00:00:56.800
These are the stories of young creatures all across the animal kingdom.

00:00:56.800 --> 00:01:00.000
It is a celebration of their journey.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:11.080
journey into adulthood through a world full of adventure, discovery, and triumph.

